= Method <method>
== Participants
Twenty adults took part.

== Procedure
=== Apparatus
A head-mounted display.

=== Adaptive staircase <staircase>
We used a 2-down 1-up staircase. The step size halved after each reversal.

$ s_(k+1) = s_k / 2 $ <step>

The threshold was the mean of the last six reversals, see @einstein and @step.
